{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/f8095ec9eb77187f1983bdb1eb9e0c36.poster.avif?t=1752169735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/f8095ec9eb77187f1983bdb1eb9e0c36.webm?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/f8095ec9eb77187f1983bdb1eb9e0c36.mp4?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Chosen Apostle, Can You Survive the Tribulation?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It all began at the turn of the millennium, a gentle shadow began to fill the countryside of Hyrinthia. All but the Apostles failed to notice the corrupting nature of the dark forces encroaching on this unsuspecting nation. The royal family fell to its seductive venality first, and then the commoners, and lastly the beasts of the earth. With few left to challenge this unknown adversity, it is up to you - a stranger to these shores, to find the Fellowship of Apostles and vanquish the evil from these lands. But beware, most are darkened, depraved of mind, and will stop at nothing to prevent you from uncovering the truth of their new masters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/b49fd4725687f70ff25f464f82b65c79.poster.avif?t=1752169735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/b49fd4725687f70ff25f464f82b65c79.webm?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/b49fd4725687f70ff25f464f82b65c79.mp4?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/c0898e9c03c8cebd7f15e4cdc38269a6.avif?t=1752169735\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Features included in the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic turn-based combat pits you against a variety of enemies ranging from bandits to savage wolves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue-lite style permadeath <i>(optional)\u00a0</i>for you and your mercenary hires along with a global meta-progression to avoid total loss after death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A level cap of 5 is included in the Demo, with the full game featuring a level cap of 20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between 9 different character classes that play drastically different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic survival elements such as eating, drinking, and sleeping. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robust map menu system for location tracking and easy-to-find points of interest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exquisite hand-drawn environments, maps, and sketched-style portraits.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An advanced lighting system creating an ominous atmosphere; <i>travel at night at your own peril</i>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A day/night cycle that influences encounters and loot drops. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide range of weapons, apparel, and items along with armor set bonuses.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lore-rich codex featuring an in-depth look at enemies and characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A basic main quest along with several side quests and daily job postings. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two towns in an open-world filled with several combat instances, random engagements, and treasures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/6d81ec353b5e3f3434deb57aa19000f4.poster.avif?t=1752169735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/6d81ec353b5e3f3434deb57aa19000f4.webm?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/6d81ec353b5e3f3434deb57aa19000f4.mp4?t=1752169735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/c0898e9c03c8cebd7f15e4cdc38269a6.avif?t=1752169735\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/extras/bc2f534253968ca9483d02f8b681b92e.avif?t=1752169735\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868280?t=1752169735","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/d52da7bc9da5b125592ec863eec3d8c4f9203761/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752169735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/2922681d486a240778c449f685606de6eea67f04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752169735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868280/2922681d486a240778c449f685606de6eea67f04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752169735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Vol